Field Meaning <code>effective_claim_tier</code> the granted tier (<code>exploratory</code> … <code>publication_grade</code>) <code>allowed_claims</code> claims the gates support <code>blocked_claims</code> claims refused, each with a <code>reason</code> and <code>artifact</code> gate entries per-gate status with a pointer to the gate artifact <p>A blocked-claim entry has the shape:</p> <pre><code>{
  "claim": "terminal_scope_claim",
  "reason": "outlet_scope_volume_mismatch",
  "artifact": "routing_flow_gates.json"
}
</code></pre>
